<title>SPAIN: Valenciana says Cementos merger approved.</title>
<headline>Valenciana says Cementos merger approved.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Valenciana de Cementos said on Monday its shareholders approved the absorption of Cementos Portland Morata de Jalon.</p>
<p>Valenciana, which owned 95.68 percent of Cementos Portland, said the merger was designed to simplify its structure and cut costs.</p>
<p>Valenciana forms part of the Mexican group Cemex.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
